    <div class="flex-container">
        <div class="panel-container">
            <div class="panel panel-default grow-1">
                <div class="panel-heading">
                    <p class="panel-title">Automazioni</p>
                </div>
                <div class="panel-body">
                    <div class="form-group mb-2">
                        <label for="cron-download">Cron Importazione Catalogo da Tyre</label>
                        <div class="input-group col-md-6">
                            <input type="text" name="cron-download-csv" id="cron-download-csv" class="form-control clipboard pointer" value="{{ cronImportProducts }}" readonly>
                            <div class="input-group-addon">
                                <span class="input-group"><i class="material-icons f-1rem">schedule</i></span>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <small class="text-info" style="margin-top: 0.5rem; display: block;"><code>Fai click sulla casella per copiare il contenuto</code></small>
                    </div>
                    <hr>
                    <div class="form-group mb-2">
                        <h4>Per creare un cron job su Linux, segui questi passaggi:</h4>
                        <p>
                            <ul>
                                <li>Apri il terminale</li>
                                <li>Digita <code>crontab -e</code></li>
                                <li>Aggiungi la riga <code>0 */4 * * * /usr/bin/php <i>{{ cronImportProducts }}</i></code></li>
                                <li>Questo cron job eseguirà il processo ogni 4 ore</li>
                            </ul>
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <script>
                        document.querySelectorAll('.clipboard').forEach(input => {
                            input.addEventListener('click', () => {
                                input.select();
                                document.execCommand('copy');
                                alert('Copiato: ' + input.value);
                            });
                        });
                    </script>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="panel">
                <div class="panel-heading">
